{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Blathine": 25,
    "Player": 4,
    "Staelle": 15
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2400101",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Staelle",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240010101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240010101": {
            "id": "240010101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Staelle",
            "text": "Please, help me out! I was just thinking about the novel's story, and before I knew it, Barea was just gone!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240010102"
            ]
          },
          "240010102": {
            "id": "240010102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Blathine",
            "text": "Are you sure you didn't leave it at your seat in the opera house, or left it tied to the restroom door, or something?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240010103"
            ]
          },
          "240010103": {
            "id": "240010103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Staelle",
            "text": "I've already searched all those areas. I've even looked under that seat, but Barea wasn't there.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240010104"
            ]
          },
          "240010104": {
            "id": "240010104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Staelle",
            "text": "Oh, the mere thought of it, that my little Barea would be kidnapped by someone, or perhaps follow someone blindly as if stricken by puppy love...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240010105"
            ]
          },
          "240010105": {
            "id": "240010105",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Blathine",
            "text": "Ms. Staelle, I'm quite sure that Barea wouldn't make the same mistake twice like that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240010106"
            ]
          },
          "240010106": {
            "id": "240010106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Staelle",
            "text": "Ah, but my Barry-boo is still so little... and little children make the same errors many times, and even revel in it, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240010107"
            ]
          },
          "240010107": {
            "id": "240010107",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Blathine",
            "text": "I'm... quite certain that Barea is not as young as you say.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240010110"
            ]
          },
          "240010110": {
            "id": "240010110",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Blathine",
            "text": "Ms. Staelle's dog...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240010111"
            ]
          },
          "240010111": {
            "id": "240010111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Staelle",
            "text": "My family.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240010112"
            ]
          },
          "240010112": {
            "id": "240010112",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Blathine",
            "text": "Yep. Her family has gone missing, and she's asking for my help.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240010113"
            ]
          },
          "240010113": {
            "id": "240010113",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Blathine",
            "text": "Ms. Staelle, we have already searched this area once. I would wager that Barea has headed off into the wilds.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240010114"
            ]
          },
          "240010114": {
            "id": "240010114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Staelle",
            "text": "Then let us go there too!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240010115"
            ]
          },
          "240010115": {
            "id": "240010115",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Blathine",
            "text": "Please, Miss, I ask you to stay in the city. With the dress you wear, you would not be able to catch Barea even if you found it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240010116"
            ]
          },
          "240010116": {
            "id": "240010116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Staelle",
            "text": "Nonsense! Why, Barea would jump into my arms if it so much as saw me!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240010117"
            ]
          },
          "240010117": {
            "id": "240010117",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Blathine",
            "text": "Then I suppose it heard us not when we were calling up and down the theater, yes?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240010118"
            ]
          },
          "240010118": {
            "id": "240010118",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Blathine",
            "text": "Well, there you have it. I'm afraid I cannot bring Barea back to Ms. Staelle alone.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240010119"
            ]
          },
          "240010119": {
            "id": "240010119",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Blathine",
            "text": "I cannot simply leave my post for long, much less ask another colleague to leave theirs with me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240010120"
            ]
          },
          "240010120": {
            "id": "240010120",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Blathine",
            "text": "But if you're willing, Traveler, could you help us both out?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2400102",
      "subQuestName": "Follow Blathine",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2400103",
      "subQuestName": "Follow Blathine",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240010301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240010301": {
            "id": "240010301",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Blathine",
            "text": "Well, there it is — and looking quite good, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240010302"
            ]
          },
          "240010302": {
            "id": "240010302",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Blathine",
            "text": "I wonder when Ms. Staelle will realize that dogs have no love for the opera, or for her novels?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240010303"
            ]
          },
          "240010303": {
            "id": "240010303",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Blathine",
            "text": "Let us return — she's probably worried sick."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2400104",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Staelle",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240010401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240010401": {
            "id": "240010401",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Staelle",
            "text": "Barea! Oh, my baby! Where have you been?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240010402"
            ]
          },
          "240010402": {
            "id": "240010402",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Blathine",
            "text": "It simply found a quiet spot to rest for a while. A bit of a vacation, you see.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240010403"
            ]
          },
          "240010403": {
            "id": "240010403",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Staelle",
            "text": "Ah, I was so worried! Thank you, Officer Blathine, thank you! You will be in my next novel for sure!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240010404"
            ]
          },
          "240010404": {
            "id": "240010404",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Blathine",
            "text": "Thank you for your consideration, but it might be best if you save the ink — I doubt anyone would be all that interested in the daily life of a police officer.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240010405"
            ]
          },
          "240010405": {
            "id": "240010405",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Staelle",
            "text": "Then I'll simply have to dramatize your tale... It will be interesting, I swear!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240010406"
            ]
          },
          "240010406": {
            "id": "240010406",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Blathine",
            "text": "That promise of yours is already too much drama for me, I think.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240010407"
            ]
          },
          "240010407": {
            "id": "240010407",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Staelle",
            "text": "Ah, the conclusion's got to be inspiring! Let me think — who shall I assign to be your partner..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2400105",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240010501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240010501": {
            "id": "240010501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Staelle",
            "text": "Is it that Barea doesn't like my new novel? *sigh* But everyone else thinks it's pretty good...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240010502"
            ]
          },
          "240010502": {
            "id": "240010502",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Staelle",
            "text": "Perhaps I should read it a nicer passage..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2400199",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240019901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240019901": {
            "id": "240019901",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Blathine",
            "text": "Barea dislikes places that are too lively. The opera house probably disturbed it and inspired its escape.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240019902"
            ]
          },
          "240019902": {
            "id": "240019902",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Blathine",
            "text": "It might be hiding in the bushes... Let's head to the patch over there.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240019903"
            ]
          },
          "240019903": {
            "id": "240019903",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Blathine",
            "text": "Not here... Hmmm, let's head elsewhere..."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}